        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(talk): open scoped plugin voice sessions",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds `runtime.talk.openSession(...)`, the active companion to the anonymous `watchActivity` feed in #110902.\n\n- Opens one Gateway-owned Realtime Talk conversation from an authenticated, entitled plugin route.\n- Returns a session handle for microphone PCM, barge-in, close, and exact output PCM/state events.\n- Keeps provider credentials, agent/workspace access, and tool coordination inside the Gateway.\n- Confines raw audio to the returned owner handle; there is no global PCM subscription.\n- Leaves existing client-owned relay and native/iOS coordination unchanged.\n- Creates output-media events only when an owner callback is present.\n\n## Stack\n\nThis PR is stacked on #110902. The independently cherry-pickable change is commit `1a5bc544ecb`; the first commit is the pending `watchActivity` base.\n\nCompanion plugin: https://github.com/RomneyDa/openclaw-avatar-plugin\n\n## Validation\n\n- Core TypeScript check passed.\n- 96 focused Talk, Gateway, Plugin SDK, and plugin runtime tests passed.\n- Full repository check passed after the final type fix.\n- Companion plugin passed typecheck, build, 51 tests, browser smoke, and clean-package install.",
